WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.690
In French, your mobile is a «portable».

2
00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.600
You may know «porter», to carry.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.760
So what could a «porteur» be?

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.890
Some words hide in disguise:

5
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.460
«forêt», «école», «hôpital».

6
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.330
Each is an English word you already know.

7
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.970
So how can one French word you know open

8
00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.180
doors to words you've never met?

9
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.930
In this mission, you'll grow
word trees from a single root.

10
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:29.980
Then you'll spin a decoder ring that
matches French spellings to English,

11
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.940
and build words in the lab.

12
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.550
Your mission: work out
how to crack a French

13
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.410
word you've never seen,
with no dictionary.
